Pi environment facts: Pi auto-loads every .ts/.js directly in ~/.pi/agent/extensions/ (and cwd/.pi/extensions/) in addition to the settings.json 'extensions' array; subdirs load only with index.ts or package.json with pi.extensions. To disable an extension, move it to a subdir like extensions/retired/ (lone files in subdirs are not loaded). prime-header.ts (settings.json-enabled splash header): renders logo + metadata (version, model/thinking, cwd, skills/prompts/packages count) via ctx.ui.setHeader on session_start; logo width 20 cols, metadata at col 24 (LOGO_WIDTH + GUTTER 4). prime-tui patches: reapply `bash ~/.pi/agent/prime-tui/apply-patches.sh` after any npm update of pi-coding-agent; patched copies live in ~/.pi/agent/prime-tui/patched/. settings-list.js — Space always toggles the selected option (stock only toggled with an empty search box) and strips spaces from search input. interactive-mode.js — fullscreen quit bug fixed by stopping the TUI with preserveScreen: true. editor.js — regular-mode overflow crash fixed via width accounting: '> ' prompt was drawn inside left padding without shrinking the text budget, making lines 2 cols too wide; TuiMainScreen.doRender throws on any line wider than the terminal (writes pi-crash.log); fullscreen never checks, so overflow only crashes in regular mode. pi-subagents extension v0.42.1 (by Nico Bailon): intercom bridge active, 8 builtin agents, 35 skills, unlimited spawn budget. <!-- created=2026-08-08, last=2026-08-08 -->